# Used by `npm run build` (production). Public values only: everything here ends up in the browser.
#
# The API lives on the storefront's own domain: https://lichtsignaturesouvenirs.store/api
# (nginx on the server forwards /api and /uploads to the LICHT backend; see deploy/nginx-storefront.conf).
# Leave VITE_API_URL empty for that. Set it only if the API is ever moved to a different domain.
VITE_API_URL=
